"色彩" = "Color";
"整体有多亮。曝光按光线倍数改变亮度，亮度更温和地调整中间调。" = "How bright the whole image is. Exposure scales the light itself; Brightness adjusts the midtones more gently.";
"明暗如何分布：对比度、高光、阴影、白色与黑色决定画面从暗到亮的层次。" = "How light and dark are spread out: contrast, highlights, shadows, whites and blacks shape the range from dark to bright.";
"让白色看起来是白的：色温调冷暖（蓝–黄），色调调绿–洋红。" = "Makes white look white: Temperature moves between cool and warm (blue–yellow), Tint between green and magenta.";
"颜色有多浓：自然饱和度优先增强偏灰的颜色，饱和度同等增强所有颜色。" = "How strong the colors are: Vibrance boosts muted colors first; Saturation boosts every color equally.";
"边缘与纹理：清晰度增强大范围反差，锐度增强细小边缘，降噪抹平颗粒。" = "Edges and texture: Clarity adds broad local contrast, Sharpness crisps fine edges, Noise Reduction smooths grain.";
"整体风格：去雾让远景更通透，褪色和颗粒像胶片，黑白去掉颜色，暗角压暗边缘。" = "Overall style: Dehaze clears distant views, Fade and Grain give a film look, Black & White removes color, and Vignette darkens the edges.";
