"黑白" = "Black & White";
"整体增加或减少曝光，以 EV 表示；+1 EV 将线性亮度加倍。过曝丢失的细节无法靠此恢复。" = "Raises or lowers overall exposure in EV; +1 EV doubles the linear light. It can't bring back detail that was blown out when shooting.";
"平衡暗部、中间调与亮部。正值提亮暗部并收住高光；这是本地算法，不等同于苹果的空间自适应鲜明度。" = "Balances shadows, midtones and highlights. Positive values lift the shadows and hold back the highlights. This is Lucet's own algorithm, not Apple's spatially adaptive Brilliance.";
"调整较亮区域；负值压低高光，尽量减少对暗部的影响。" = "Adjusts the brighter areas. Negative values pull highlights down while leaving the shadows mostly alone.";
"调整较暗区域；正值提亮阴影，可能同时显露噪点。" = "Adjusts the darker areas. Positive values lift the shadows and may reveal noise.";
"调整整体显示亮度。与按倍数改变线性亮度的曝光不同。" = "Adjusts overall display brightness. Unlike Exposure, it doesn't scale the linear light.";
"拉开或收拢明暗差距。过高会损失暗部与亮部层次。" = "Spreads light and dark apart or brings them together. Too much loses detail at both ends.";
"调整接近白色的区域；正值提高白色端，负值压低白色端。" = "Adjusts the areas close to white. Positive values raise the white end; negative values lower it.";
"调整黑色端；正值加深黑色，负值抬起黑色。" = "Adjusts the black end. Positive values deepen the blacks; negative values lift them.";
"相对白平衡：正值偏暖，负值偏冷。这里是处理后素材的相对偏移，不是相机拍摄 Kelvin 值。" = "Relative white balance: positive is warmer, negative cooler. It's a shift applied to the processed image, not the camera's Kelvin setting.";
"相对白平衡：正值偏洋红，负值偏绿色，用于校正或创作色偏。" = "Relative white balance: positive leans magenta, negative green. Use it to correct or create a color cast.";
"整体颜色强度。-100 变为灰度；过高容易造成颜色溢出。" = "Overall color intensity. −100 turns the image gray; too much can clip colors.";
"优先增强较不鲜艳的颜色，减少对已经鲜艳颜色的影响；不包含专用肤色保护模型。" = "Boosts less vivid colors first and leaves already-vivid colors mostly alone. There's no dedicated skin-tone protection model.";
"增强较大范围的局部反差；过高可能出现边缘光晕。" = "Adds local contrast over broad areas. Too much can create halos along edges.";
"增强细小边缘反差，不能恢复失焦时丢失的真实细节。" = "Adds contrast to fine edges. It can't restore real detail lost to missed focus.";
"使用单帧降噪；数值越大画面越平滑。视频不使用时序降噪，强度过大可能丢失纹理。" = "Reduces noise frame by frame; higher values look smoother. Video doesn't use temporal noise reduction, and too much can lose texture.";
"逐渐压暗画面边缘，引导注意力到中央。" = "Gradually darkens the edges to draw the eye to the center.";
"往右减少雾气、霾和远处的灰白，远景更清楚、颜色更浓；往左增加朦胧感。用暗通道估计每个区域的雾有多重。" = "Right removes mist, haze and the gray wash over distant land, so far details are clearer and colors richer; left adds a soft haze. Estimates how hazy each area is with the dark-channel method.";
"抬起最暗处、压低最亮处，像褪色的胶片，画面更柔和。" = "Lifts the darkest tones and lowers the brightest, like faded film, for a softer picture.";
"加入胶片颗粒，中间调最明显。颗粒大小随照片尺寸变化，预览和导出一致。" = "Adds film grain, strongest in the midtones. Grain size follows the photo size, so the preview matches the export.";
"往右逐渐去掉颜色，100 为完全黑白。HSL 里各颜色的明亮度仍会影响黑白的深浅。" = "Right gradually removes color; 100 is fully black and white. The HSL luminance of each color still sets how light or dark it turns.";
"基础调色滤镜不可用，未应用调整。" = "The basic adjustment filter is unavailable, so no adjustments were applied.";

