"已选中主体，红色是调整的范围。用反转按钮改为调整背景。" = "Subject selected; red shows what's adjusted. Use the invert button to adjust the background instead.";
"只调整画面的一部分：渐变适合压暗天空，椭圆适合提亮主体，画笔可以涂出任何地方。" = "Adjust just part of the picture: a gradient suits darkening a sky, an ellipse brightening a subject, and the brush can paint any area.";
"只调整画面的一部分：比如用渐变压暗天空、用椭圆提亮人物，或者用画笔涂出要改的地方。" = "Adjust just part of the picture: darken the sky with a gradient, brighten a person with an ellipse, or paint over what you want to change with the brush.";
"渐变：从一条线开始逐渐过渡到另一条线，常用来压暗天空。" = "Gradient: fades from one line to another, often used to darken a sky.";
"椭圆：调整椭圆里面（或外面）的部分，常用来提亮主体、压暗四周。" = "Ellipse: adjusts inside (or outside) an ellipse, often used to brighten a subject or darken the surroundings.";
