"用 macOS 的主体识别（和「照片」里抠出主体相同）找出前景里的人物、动物和物体。羽化让边缘更柔和；反转按钮改为调整背景，比如压暗背景、突出人物。" = "Uses macOS subject detection (the same as lifting a subject in Photos) to find people, animals and objects in front. Feather softens the edge; the invert button switches to the background, for example to darken it so a person stands out.";
"把要去掉的东西完整涂满，边缘多涂一点。光集会在周围找相似的纹理来填补（PatchMatch，在这台 Mac 上计算）。适合电线、路人、垃圾、灰尘这类较小的东西；涂得太大时效果会变差，可以分几次去除。" = "Cover the whole thing, a little past its edge. Lucet finds similar texture nearby to fill it in (PatchMatch, computed on this Mac). Works best on smaller things such as wires, passers-by, litter and dust; very large areas come out worse, so remove them in a few goes.";
