"锐化" = "Sharpening";
"直方图把照片里每个像素按亮度排队：左边是暗的，右边是亮的。山峰在哪里，照片的大部分就在哪里。" = "The histogram lines up every pixel in the photo by brightness: dark on the left, bright on the right. Wherever the peak is, that's where most of the photo is.";
"曝光让整张照片同时变亮或变暗，就像拍摄时多进一点或少进一点光。+1 EV 等于光线加倍。" = "Exposure makes the whole photo brighter or darker at once, as if more or less light had come in when you shot it. +1 EV doubles the light.";
"高光只调整较亮的区域，比如天空和白云。往下拉能找回还没完全过曝的层次。" = "Highlights adjusts only the brighter areas, like sky and white clouds. Pulling it down brings back detail that isn't completely blown out.";
"阴影只调整较暗的区域。往上拉能看清背光处的细节，但也可能显出噪点。" = "Shadows adjusts only the darker areas. Raising it reveals detail in backlit places, but may also show noise.";
"白色决定最亮的地方有多白，黑色决定最暗的地方有多黑。它们设定画面的两端。" = "Whites sets how white the brightest parts are, and Blacks how black the darkest parts are. Together they set the two ends of the image.";
"对比度拉开或收拢明暗差距。对比低显得灰、柔；对比高显得硬朗、有冲击力。" = "Contrast spreads light and dark apart or brings them together. Low contrast looks gray and soft; high contrast looks bold and punchy.";
"纯白或纯黑的区域已经没有细节。开启溢出显示后，纯白显示为红色、纯黑显示为蓝色。" = "Pure white or pure black areas have no detail left. With the clipping view on, pure white shows in red and pure black in blue.";
"白平衡让白色看起来是白的。色温控制冷暖（蓝–黄），色调控制绿–洋红。" = "White balance makes white look white. Temperature controls cool to warm (blue–yellow); Tint controls green to magenta.";
"自然饱和度优先增强不太鲜艳的颜色，已经很鲜艳的颜色和肤色变化较小，比饱和度更不容易过头。" = "Vibrance boosts less vivid colors first and changes already-vivid colors and skin tones less, so it's harder to overdo than Saturation.";
"HSL 只改一种颜色：比如只让蓝天更深、只让树叶更黄，其他颜色不受影响。" = "HSL changes just one color: make only the blue sky deeper, or only the leaves more yellow, and leave every other color alone.";
"降低蓝色的明亮度、略微提高饱和度，天空会更深、云更立体，地面不受影响。" = "Lower the blue luminance and raise its saturation a little: the sky gets deeper and the clouds stand out, while the ground stays the same.";
"健康的肤色在矢量图上落在一条斜线附近。偏离太多会显得发红或发黄。" = "Healthy skin tones fall near a diagonal line on the vectorscope. Too far off and they look red or yellow.";
"曲线可以单独改变任何一段亮度。最经典的是 S 曲线：暗部更暗、亮部更亮，中间调基本不变。" = "Curves can change any part of the brightness range on its own. The classic is the S curve: darker shadows, brighter highlights, midtones mostly unchanged.";
"色轮分别给暗部、中间调、亮部加上颜色。比如暗部偏青、亮部偏橙，就是常见的电影感。" = "Color wheels add color separately to the shadows, midtones and highlights. Teal shadows with orange highlights, for example, is a common cinematic look.";
"LUT 是一张颜色对照表，把每种颜色换成另一种，一键得到一种风格。强度可以控制用多少。" = "A LUT is a color lookup table: it swaps each color for another to give a whole look in one click. Strength controls how much is applied.";
"Log 模式故意拍得很灰，为了保留更多高光和暗部。需要先套用相机厂商的转换 LUT，画面才会恢复正常。" = "Log mode records a deliberately flat, gray image to keep more highlight and shadow detail. Apply the camera maker's conversion LUT first to make it look normal.";
"波形图的横向对应画面从左到右，纵向是亮度。贴着顶部的平线表示过曝，贴着底部表示死黑。" = "Across the waveform is the image from left to right; up is brightness. A flat line along the top means overexposure; along the bottom, crushed blacks.";
"RGB 分量把红、绿、蓝分开显示。灰色或白色的物体，三栏应该差不多高；某栏特别高就说明偏色。" = "The RGB parade shows red, green and blue separately. Gray or white objects should be about the same height in all three; one much higher means a color cast.";
"矢量图显示颜色：方向代表色相，离中心越远越鲜艳。斜线是肤色参考线。" = "The vectorscope shows color: direction is hue, and the farther from the center, the more vivid. The diagonal line is the skin-tone reference.";
"地平线歪了会让画面不稳。拉直后会自动裁掉一点边缘。" = "A tilted horizon makes a picture feel unsteady. Straightening crops a little off the edges automatically.";
"裁剪可以去掉干扰元素。把主体放在三分线附近，画面通常更有张力。" = "Cropping removes distractions. Placing the subject near a rule-of-thirds line usually makes the picture more dynamic.";
"锐化增强细小边缘，让细节更清楚。要放大到 100% 判断，过度会出现白边。" = "Sharpening adds crispness to fine edges so details read more clearly. Judge it at 100%; too much creates white halos.";
"降噪让画面更干净，但过强会抹掉纹理，看起来像塑料。" = "Noise reduction makes the image cleaner, but too much smears texture and looks plastic.";
"Live Photo 是一张封面照片加一段 0.5–3 秒的视频。选好片段和封面，就能在 iPhone 上按住播放。" = "A Live Photo is a key photo plus a 0.5–3 second video. Choose the clip and the key photo, then press and hold it on your iPhone to play.";
"右侧贴边表示高光溢出，左侧贴边表示暗部溢出；峰值位置比形状更重要。这里统计的是 SDR 显示结果。" = "Piling against the right edge means clipped highlights; against the left, clipped shadows. Where the peak sits matters more than its shape. This counts the SDR display result.";
"曝光作用在线性光上，是乘法：高光会比暗部变化得更多，所以先看高光是否会溢出。" = "Exposure works on linear light as a multiplier: highlights change more than shadows, so check first whether the highlights will clip.";
"高光权重约从亮度 45% 开始，越亮作用越强；与白色配合：先用高光压缩，再用白色定白点。" = "Highlights starts acting at about 45% brightness and gets stronger as it gets brighter. Pair it with Whites: compress with Highlights first, then set the white point with Whites.";
"阴影权重在亮度 60% 以下逐渐增强。抬阴影会降低整体对比，可再用对比度或曲线补回。" = "Shadows gets gradually stronger below 60% brightness. Lifting shadows lowers overall contrast; add it back with Contrast or a curve.";
"白色作用于亮度 70% 以上，黑色作用于 25% 以下；它们决定直方图两端的位置。" = "Whites acts above 70% brightness and Blacks below 25%; they decide where the two ends of the histogram sit.";
"对比度围绕 50% 灰拉伸亮度；曲线可以选择支点和范围，更精细。" = "Contrast stretches brightness around 50 percent gray; a curve lets you choose the pivot and range for finer control.";
"比屏幕能显示的最白还亮（或比最黑还暗）的部分被截断。原片中已经截断的数据无法通过调色恢复。" = "Anything brighter than the whitest the screen can show (or darker than the blackest) is cut off. Data already clipped in the original can't be recovered by adjusting.";
"这里是对已渲染画面的相对校正，不是相机原始数据的开尔文值；用接近中性灰的像素判断偏色最可靠。" = "This is a relative correction of the rendered image, not a Kelvin value from raw camera data. Near-neutral gray pixels are the most reliable way to judge a cast.";
"自然饱和度的增益随像素已有饱和度递减，避免已饱和颜色溢出色域。" = "Vibrance's boost shrinks as a pixel's existing saturation grows, so saturated colors don't clip out of gamut.";
"每个色系在相邻色系之间平滑过渡；低饱和像素受影响更小，避免灰色物体被染色。" = "Each color range blends smoothly into its neighbors, and low-saturation pixels are affected less so gray objects don't pick up color.";
"蓝色 / 青色的明亮度负值会压暗天空；配合高光可恢复云层细节。注意天空边缘的过渡。" = "Negative blue / aqua luminance darkens the sky; combined with Highlights it brings back cloud detail. Watch the transition at the sky's edges.";
"肤色线在 Cb/Cr 平面约 123°。用 HSL 橙色的色相微调可以让肤色回到线上。" = "The skin-tone line sits at about 123° on the Cb/Cr plane. Nudging the orange hue in HSL brings skin back onto the line.";
"曲线在调色顺序中位于色轮之后、HSL 之前；RGB 主曲线先作用，再应用单通道曲线。" = "Curves come after the color wheels and before HSL in the processing order; the master RGB curve applies first, then the single-channel curves.";
"Lift 作用于暗部、Gain 作用于亮部、Gamma 作用于中间调、Offset 平移整体；色点方向与矢量图一致。" = "Lift acts on the shadows, Gain on the highlights, Gamma on the midtones, and Offset shifts everything; the dot's direction matches the vectorscope.";
"LUT 有输入色彩空间：创意 LUT 通常是 Rec.709 / sRGB 输入；Log 转换 LUT 需要对应相机的 Log 输入。" = "LUTs expect a specific input color space: creative LUTs usually take Rec.709 / sRGB; Log conversion LUTs need the matching camera's Log input.";
"Log 素材的直方图挤在中间、饱和度很低；先转换到 Rec.709，再做一级和二级调色。" = "Log footage has a histogram bunched in the middle and very low saturation. Convert it to Rec.709 first, then do primary and secondary grading.";
"波形以 0–100 表示亮度。曝光正确的天空通常在 70–90，肤色在 50–70 左右。" = "The waveform shows brightness from 0 to 100. A well-exposed sky usually sits around 70–90, skin around 50–70.";
"白平衡准确时，中性区域在三栏中高度一致；用它来判断色温 / 色调该往哪边调。" = "With accurate white balance, neutral areas reach the same height in all three columns; use that to decide which way Temperature / Tint should go.";
"图中方框是 75% 饱和度的标准色靶点；颜色点云越接近方框越鲜艳。" = "The boxes are standard color targets at 75 percent saturation; the closer the color cloud gets to them, the more vivid.";
"自动拉直使用地平线识别；可信度低时不会自动应用。" = "Auto Straighten uses horizon detection and won't apply itself when confidence is low.";
"常用比例：4:5 适合社交平台竖图，16:9 适合横屏，1:1 适合方形网格。" = "Common ratios: 4:5 for portrait posts on social media, 16:9 for widescreen, 1:1 for square grids.";
"锐化半径随画面尺寸缩放，预览和导出一致；建议在降噪之后、导出之前完成。" = "The sharpening radius scales with image size, so the preview matches the export. Do it after noise reduction and before exporting.";
"降噪在调色链最前端进行，避免后续提亮放大噪点。" = "Noise reduction runs first in the processing chain so later brightening doesn't amplify the noise.";
"输出需为 0.5–3 秒；可用变速把较长片段压缩进 3 秒，背景音乐保持原节奏。" = "The output must be 0.5–3 seconds. Speed changes can squeeze a longer clip into 3 seconds while background music keeps its tempo.";
